WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.920
The world's best female football player, Ada Hegerberg!

00:00:10.480 --> 00:00:11.780
I'm okay.

00:00:12.560 --> 00:00:14.520
I have six kids, I'm not going to have any more.

00:00:14.740 --> 00:00:16.060
It's okay.

00:00:16.060 --> 00:00:18.460
I have had the children I should, in life.

00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:19.820
But ...

00:00:19.900 --> 00:00:22.540
That was not my intention!

00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:24.520
You handled that so well!

00:00:24.520 --> 00:00:25.740
I'm so sorry!

00:00:25.760 --> 00:00:26.880
I didn't mean to!

00:00:26.880 --> 00:00:27.700
That's fine!

00:00:29.700 --> 00:00:30.580
That's fine!

